    "title": "4 people hurt in crash tied to NC Central homecoming party, law enforcement says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WRAL staff ,\n7 hours ago Four people were injured in a crash Wednesday night in Orange County that was tied to a massive party in Person County for NC Central University's homecoming. According to law enforcement, the crash happened around 8:24 p.m. on Gray Road just north of Berry Road from \"a large party taking place with a multi-college gathering.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
